# ── Terraform ────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# ── Terraform variable files ─────────────────────────────
